      "title": "OpenAI annualised revenues $20B less than previously signalled",
      "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/open-ai-revenue-nvidia-oracle-coreweave.html",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50008187",
      "score": 342,
      "comments": 237,
      "author": "mfiguiere",
      "published": "2026-10-08T16:45:58Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Revised revenue figures highlight stark unit-economic challenges between soaring frontier-model training costs and realized recurring software revenue.",
        "The shortfall signals slower enterprise API monetization alongside aggressive margin compression from open-weight alternatives like Meta's Llama.",
        "Cash-flow deficits heighten dependency on venture equity to subsidize massive forward CapEx commitments for Nvidia GPUs and Microsoft Azure compute."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
