      "score": 123,
      "comments": 50,
      "author": "mtlynch",
      "published": "2026-10-07T13:09:33Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Trivial tutorials masquerading as production guides often omit operational realities, error handling, and real-world failure modes.",
        "Publishing code snippets without explicit dependency versions, runtime environments, or reproducible repositories accelerates technical obsolescence.",
        "Advocating complex patterns like microservices or distributed systems without trade-off analyses encourages harmful, premature overengineering."
      ]
    },
