      "bullets": [
        "Public TLS certificate validity drops from 398 to 64 days by February 2027 under updated browser root store policies.",
        "Automated issuance via ACME or vault integrations becomes mandatory, rendering manual certificate tracking and renewals completely unviable.",
        "Organizations must audit edge infrastructure, ingress controllers, and load balancers to reliably support continuous, rapid certificate rotation cycles."
      ]
    },
