        "Margaret Hamilton, who led development of the Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC) flight software, has passed away.",
        "Her team's asynchronous priority-scheduling architecture famously prevented CPU overload during Apollo 11's lunar module descent.",
        "Beyond coining \"software engineering,\" she pioneered modern fault-tolerant design and founded Higher Order Software and Hamilton Technologies."
